{"id":"rocher","lemma":"rocher","pos":"noun","rank":3457,"glosses":["rock (mass of projecting rock)"],"ipa":"/ʁɔ.ʃe/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f7/Fr-rocher.ogg/Fr-rocher.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"rochers"},"formAudio":{"rochers":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-rochers.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Les rochers sont glissants.","en":"The rocks are slippery.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Il s'est caché derrière un grand rocher.","en":"He hid himself behind a large rock.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"hidden"},{"g":"behind"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big"},null]},{"text":"Leur bateau a heurté un rocher.","en":"Their ship struck a rock.","words":[{"g":"them"},{"g":"boat"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"jerky"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ne jette pas de rochers dans la rivière.","en":"Don't throw rocks into the river.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to throw","l":"jeter"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"a river"}]},{"text":"Il se cogna la tête contre un rocher.","en":"He hit his head against a rock.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to whack","l":"cogner"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"head"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}